WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.570
Canada built your retirement savings in five steps. The fifth isn't about retirement at all.

2
00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:14.410
Step one, 1952: Old Age Security, a basic pension in old age.

3
00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:24.470
But a basic pension is only a floor. So in 1957, the RRSP: a tax break for saving on your own.

4
00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:30.980
1966: the Canada Pension Plan, a pension you earn by working.

5
00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:36.920
2009: the TFSA, where your savings grow tax-free.

6
00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:43.690
And the fifth, 2023: the FHSA, savings for your first home.

7
00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:48.460
71 years, from the first to the newest.

8
00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:52.030
Every date here is checked at its official source.

9
00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:57.400
Five accounts, one system, built a layer at a time.

10
00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:00.000
Education only, not advice.
